UID:6a27118a90cc4e3a790c8ad5@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:This workshop highlights the importance of the hydrological c
 ycle\; the movement and flow of water on Earth. We also discuss climate c
 hange strategies and population impacts in different regions. Children wi
 ll conduct experiments using various liquids to test their pH levels and 
 compare results\nRegistration is required. For ages 10-13 only (children 
 outside of this age range will not be able to participate).\n*For all regi
 stered Children's programs at Malvern\, there is a grace period of 10 minu
 tes. After the first 10 minutes of a program\, spots will be given to wait
 ing customers.*\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information 
