BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Solar Observing Party
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260728T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260728T150000
UID:6a2d8476f56bd86e00b69135@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us to observe the Sun safely using telescopes fitted with
  certified solar filters. On a clear day\, participants will explore sunsp
 ots\, prominences\, and other solar features in real time.\nA short presen
 tation on the Sun will be given at the beginning. This program will be run
  by two PhD students studying astronomy at the University of Toronto. They
 'll be happy to answer your 'burning' questions about the sun and space.\n
 For all ages! Children must be accompanied by a caregiver.\nDrop in\, no r
 egistration required.
LOCATION:High Park\, Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a2d8476f56bd86e00b69135
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — School Age
