DESCRIPTION:Looking for something to do after school? Come out to our Afte
 r School Club and learn new things\, make stuff\, meet other kids and have
  fun! Drop-in\, space is limited.\nJune 24: Summer crafts\nSnacks are offe
 red during the After School Club for participants.\nFood may contain or ha
 ve come into contact with common allergens. Ingredient lists will be avail
