DESCRIPTION:Looking for something to do after school? Come out to our Afte
 r School Club and learn new things.\nThroughout June\, we will explore a F
 IFA - themed program. Learn coding\, teamwork\, and robot control while gu
 iding Dash through by FIFA. Score goals\, complete challenges\, and work t
 ogether as a team.\nSnacks are offered during the After School Club for pa
 rticipants. Ingredient lists will be available. Snacks are generously supp
 orted\, in part\, by donors.
LOCATION:Steeles\, Program Room
