SUMMARY:Egg Carton Coral Reefs
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260806T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260806T150000
UID:6a065878278f7c2f008d4056@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Did you know that even though coral reef habitat covers less t
 han one percent of the ocean\, they actually provide a home for nearly a q
 uarter of all ocean species? Join us to make a miniature coral reef using 
 recycled materials and tissue paper\, and learn more about coral reefs and
  how we can help protect them.\nFor kids ages 6-12. Registration is requir
 ed.\nPlease register online or call 416-396-8964.\nInformation Collection 
 Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is collected by the Toronto
