BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Coding with Ozobots
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260720T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260722T150000
UID:6a1e1a9ce13d3b4603b623be@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:For ages 9 to 12.  Registration opens June 15.\nJoin us for
  a fun 3-day mini camp where kids will explore the exciting world of codin
 g through hands-on play with Ozobots! Kids will learn how to program their
  Ozobots using simple block-based coding that will make their robots move\
 , light up\, and respond. Kids will also experiment with colour coding usi
 ng markets\, drawing paths and colour sequence that guides Ozobots through
  challenges\, mazes and games\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe persona
 l information on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Library unde
 r the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The infor
