UID:6a3004fdc7d3cd5800607789@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Henna art is an ancient form of body art\, used in various cel
 ebrations from different parts of the world. It is prepared with the fines
 t blend of henna powder and essential oils like lavender\, eucalyptus\, an
 d/or cajeput oil. Learn about henna art\, practice using it\, and receive 
 a special World Cup design by a professional henna artist.\nFor children a
 ges 6 and up\, teens and adults. Please register everyone attending.\nInfo
 rmation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is colle
 cted by the Toronto Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\, sectio
