BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Hands-On Dinosaur Fossils & Ancient Life
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260902T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260902T143000
UID:6a1d8c1b2ea730c17ab34bcb@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an opportunity to handle\, examine up close and di
 scuss nine real and replica fossils in this fascinating hands-on workshop.
  Participants will be entertained and educated\, not just about the fossil
 s themselves\, but the paleontological aspects that underpin them. Concept
 s include: evolution\, fossilization\, ‘The Tree of Life’ (phylogeny) 
 and — of course — dinosaurs!\nFor children ages 6-12. Parents are wel
 come to stay during the program\, but please only register children.\nInfo
 rmation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is colle
 cted by the Toronto Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\, sectio
