SUMMARY:Wonder Workshop: Pollution Challenge
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260724T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260724T153000
UID:6a076dedc6a1dc3d00d3f8de@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Do you ever think about the impact of one little person or one
  tiny thing on the planet? When one pollutant becomes many\, the planet hu
 rts. But when one person becomes many\, positive change can happen. In thi
 s workshop\, you will design and build your own creature or machine that w
 ill help keep our precious planet clean! Plus\, enter a prize draw for a c
 hance to win an awesome book. For kids ages 4 to 8. Space is limited.\nInf
 ormation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is coll
 ected by the Toronto Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\, secti
 ons 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will only be used for event
