DESCRIPTION:Celebrate soccer's biggest event at Guildwood Library! Drop in
  for the following live screenings of scheduled matches in our program roo
 m.\nThursday June 11\, @ 3pm: Mexico vs. South Africa\nFriday June 12\, @
  3pm: Canada vs. Bosnia and Herzegovina\nTuesday June 16\, @ 3pm: France v
 s. Senegal\nThursday June 18\, @ 3pm: Switzerland vs. Bosnia and Herzegov
 ina\nThursday June 18\, @ 6pm: Canada vs. Qatar\nFriday June 19\, @ 3pm: U
 SMNT vs. Australia\nSaturday June 20\, @ 1pm: Netherlands vs. Sweden\nTues
 day June 23\, @ 1pm: Portugal vs. Uzbekistan\nTuesday June 23\, @ 4pm: En
 gland vs. Ghana\nWednesday June 24\, @3pm: Switzerland vs. Canada\nThursda
 y June 25\, @4pm: Ecuador vs. Germany\nFriday June 26\, @3pm: France vs. N
 orway\nCelebrate soccer’s biggest event at TPL! #FWC26\, #WeAreToronto
LOCATION:Guildwood
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a28902e90cc4e3a790ce0d9
