BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Wonder Workshop: Adaptation Challenge
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260810T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260810T150000
UID:6a15e4a490cc4e3a79091794@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Wonder how you’d see and survive the world from a spider’s
  perspective?  Learn about amazing arachnid adaptations\, design your own 
 machine and brainstorm creative solutions to survival challenges. Plus\, e
 nter a prize draw for a chance to win an awesome book.\nFor kids ages 6 to
  10.\nSpace is limited.\nRegistration begins on July 6th.
LOCATION:Scarborough Civic Centre\, Program Room
