DESCRIPTION:Celebrate soccer's biggest event at TPL! #FWC26\, #WeAreToront
 o. Please note that screenings are\nonly during branch open hours\,\nif th
 ere are no conflicting programs in that space during that time\, and that 
 entire games may end at least twenty minutes before the branch closes. Sea
