UID:6a0de5c58e677a28001d4690@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Have you ever wondered about the earth's water supply? Togethe
 r\, we will consider how pollution is impacting the ocean and the sea crea
 tures that live here. Use your imagination and brainstorm creative solutio
 ns to develop a machine that cleans the ocean of trash and pollution. Plus
 \, enter a random draw for a chance to win a book prize.\nInformation Coll
 ection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is collected by the 
 Toronto Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 2
