BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Wonder Workshop: Clean Water Challenge
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260727T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260727T120000
UID:6a1df21890cc4e3a790aa505@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Have you ever wondered about the earth’s water supply? Toget
 her\, we will consider how pollution is impacting the ocean and the sea cr
 eatures that live there. Use your imagination and brainstorm creative solu
 tions to develop a machine that cleans the ocean of trash and pollution. P
