SUMMARY:After School Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260618T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260618T170000
UID:69fb56e7f89ee1580050e0cd@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:For ages 6-8.\nLooking for something to do after school? Come 
 out to our After School Club and learn new things\, make stuff\, meet othe
 r kids and have fun! This June\, we will be exploring different games to 
 help kids practice essential life skills. Whether they are coordinating a 
 giant parachute or racing the clock\, your child will be building better c
 ommunication habits and learning how to lead and follow within a team. Mov
 e\, think\, and collaborate!\nSnacks are offered during the After School C
 lub for participants. Ingredient lists will be available. Snacks are gener
 ously supported\, in part\, by donors.\nDrop in. No registration required\
 , but space is limited.
LOCATION:Fairview\, Room 201
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69fb56e7f89ee1580050e0cd
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — School Age
