 nCool off at the library and watch an animated film with your family!\nRat
 ed PG. Free tickets will be available in the theatre lobby 15 min before t
 he movie on a first come\, first served basis. Space is limited. Large gro
 ups and daycares must register ahead of time\, and spots are limited. No a
 dmittance after 2:10 p.m. or once venue is at capacity. Please note that t
 he main entrance to the theatre is outside the library on ground level.\nP
