UID:6a2d948d8ea300e2631d6c38@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Discover the science behind things that make you go… ewww! M
 ake “snot” and sneeze it while exploring viscosity\, identify various 
 animals from their scat (i.e.\, poop)\, and learn about digestion while pr
 oducing a burp in a bag. Join us on a gross but fun-filled science advent
 ure!\nJoin this hands-on STEM adventure with Scientists in School!\nFor
  children ages 4-12 years (Children under six may require the assistance o
 f an adult).\nRegistration required.\nInformation Collection Notice: The p
 ersonal information on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Librar
