 l lead you through the basics of creating fun\, compelling characters\, st
 ory outlines\, and then he will show you how to combine everything togethe
 r to lay out and draw your own comic!\nProgram runs for three days July 20
 th to July 22nd\, from 1pm-3pm. Each child must be available to attend all
  three days. Program is suitable for ages 9 to 11 years old.\nInformatio
 n Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is collected b
