DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260811T150000
UID:6a0f29c4e8af4a2f007412a3@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Explore design thinking as kids send their toys for a spin in 
 a tailored cardboard vehicle! Whether they create a car\, train\, rocket\,
  plane\, or something completely new\, kids (and toys) will love to go on 
 an imaginative adventure. Bring in your teddies to test out your vehicle a
 nd do a photoshoot!\nFor ages 6-12. Makedo equipment will not be taken hom
 e. Please register on the TPL website.
